sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Station
    participant Bike
    participant Rental
    User->>App: selectBike(bikeId) (m0)
    App->>Bike: checkAvailable() (m1)
    Bike-->>App: Available (m2)
    App->>Station: releaseBike() (m3)
    Station->>Bike: unlock() (m4)
    App->>Rental: start() (m5)
    Rental-->>App: rental started (m6)
    App-->>User: unlocked, ride started (m7)
